				<h1 id="versionHeadLine" class="headline">

Board of Directors		</h1>
	
		<div id="cc36c96d1e-8d42-49c2-ad06-7b47cec421e7" data-containerid="36c96d1e-8d42-49c2-ad06-7b47cec421e7" class="pageContent cpGrid cpGrid24"  >
			

		<div class="row outer wide"><!--
--><div class="outer col col24 first last" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="9dd040ad-d5a1-4f83-8748-0161db3d49ca">				
	<div class="row nest first last wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col24 first last idf731ece5-4b12-4bf4-b552-02b6af9f4f38" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="f731ece5-4b12-4bf4-b552-02b6af9f4f38">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditorc3679a04-4112-4de9-8bab-82c576323ca8" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p data-pasted="true">ACWD is governed by a five-member Board of Directors, elected to staggered four-year terms by registered voters within the cities of Fremont, Newark and Union City. &nbsp;The Board sets policy, guides long‑term planning, and ensures the District provides safe, reliable water service.</p><h2 class="subhead1">Directors</h2><p>The Board transitioned from at-large to ward-based elections in 2022. Voters within the ACWD service area now elect their representatives on the ACWD Board based on which ward they are in, and voters only elect one representative for their ward. &nbsp;Find the director who represents you in the <a href="https://arcg.is/1iOer8" data-pasted="true" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Interactive Ward Map</a></p><p><a href="https://arcg.is/1iOer8" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=7933" class="fr-fil fr-dib" alt="Board of Director Wards and photos of Board members" style="width: 708px;"></a></p><h2 class="subhead1">Meet the Directors</h2>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
	$(document).ready(function (e) {		
	    renderSlideshowIfApplicable($('#divEditor' + 'c3679a04-4112-4de9-8bab-82c576323ca8'));
	});
</script>
</div>

	</div> <!-- inner column -->

	</div> <!-- inner row -->

